            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "I would appreciate if it was possible to create project-local sessions. Or alternatively, automatically make the outer terminal `cd` to the correct directory when opening a session (is that even possible?) Sorry if this is already a thing, I haven't played around that much with sessions.",
